// Translate in place: replace the //RS lines below with the 1:1 Jet port (keep `// Rust: <file>:<line>` anchors).
//RS //! D-PERFSESSION1=D: `jet perf` family over one versioned `.jettrace` truth.
//RS //!
//RS //! `run`/`test` spawn the exact base-intent driver (`jet run|test …`).
//RS //! with observe enabled, poll live facts while the child runs, then write one
//RS //! `.jettrace` with wall/alloc/tasks/locks/io/native/task-observation spans before
//RS //! exiting with the child's code.
//RS //! `attach`/`view`/`compare`/`export` share the same artifact verify seam.
//RS //! Capture reuses the observe live snapshot (D-OBSERVE-LIVE1) attributed to a
//RS //! Jet source symbol.
//RS 
